{"id":"n70090-1-8","stage":4,"title":"예전 · 很久以前","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70090-1-8-1","ko":"오랜만이다. 우리 이십 년 만인가?","zh":"好久不见了。我们已经有二十年没见了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만이다.","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만이다","audio":"/audio/2717cc54c81e069d3c0a.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"이십","meaning":"二十","explanation":"이십：二十","readings":[{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31648","senseId":"1","lemma":"이십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이십","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3"}},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}},{"text":"만인가?","meaning":"满，整","explanation":"만：满，整；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29734","senseId":"1","lemma":"만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만인가","audio":"/audio/d5db8741efe5b64c6cc6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"b97d27f097a8b4a0","term":"이십","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/b97d27f097a8b4a033bb.mp3","entryId":"31648","definition":"十的两倍的数目。","pronunciation":["이ː십"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"0fa2841136f2a818","term":"만","zh":"满，整","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3","entryId":"29734","definition":"指日、周、月、年、年龄等正好达到一定期间。","pronunciation":["만"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d7150ec7a4c6212144f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70090-1-8-2","ko":"넌 어렸을 때랑 얼굴이 똑같다. 어쩜 예전 모습 그대로니?","zh":"你的脸和小时候一模一样，怎么还保持着以前的模样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때랑","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때랑","audio":"/audio/bed2d62469e306bea080.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"똑같다.","meaning":"一模一样，很相似","explanation":"똑같다：一模一样，很相似；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"똑같다","audio":"/audio/12ae97d19f143471d482.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70801","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똑같다","audio":"/audio/12ae97d19f143471d482.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩜","meaning":"因出乎预料的事情而惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","explanation":"어쩜：因出乎预料的事情而惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","readings":[{"term":"어쩜","audio":"/audio/63dbd7e7aeabb3635039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15092","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩜","audio":"/audio/63dbd7e7aeabb3635039.mp3"}},{"text":"예전","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}},{"text":"모습","meaning":"样子，模样","explanation":"모습：样子，模样","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"1","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}},{"text":"그대로니?","meaning":"照原样，就那么，原封不动地","explanation":"그대로：照原样，就那么，原封不动地；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"그대로","audio":"/audio/ae35dc181aceaec58c58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36255","senseId":"1","lemma":"그대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그대로니","audio":"/audio/577a4729a2e03dff7cbe.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5